  "content": "\n\n<center>\n\n##  Supplementaries²\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a>\n<hr>\n\n## 📖关于 📖\n</center>\n\n这是 Supplementaries 模组的一个扩展插件，旨在为其部分方块添加变种，并加入一些未能收录进主模组的杂项功能。\n\n主要功能包括：\n* 彩色袋子\n* 木质变种物品架\n* 金色烛台\n* 泥灰台阶与墙壁\n* 金属相框\n* 牌匾\n\n<center>\n\n## ❤️支持我❤️\n</center>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组花费了我大量时间，如果你认可我的作品并希望支持我，可以通过此处进行赞助。作为回报，你将获得专属定制的地球仪或雕像！此外，如果你通过 Akliz 购买服务器并使用优惠码 \"supplementaries\"，同样适用此活动。</span></p>\n<center>\n\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a>\n</center>\n<br>需要服务器？来看看 Akliz，他们专为模组版 Minecraft 提供顶级品牌服务器。\n他们拥有温馨活跃的社区和优质的客服支持，服务器运行体验极佳。<br>使用优惠码 \"supplementaries\" 可享 20% 折扣，同时也能支持到我的开发工作！\n<br>\n\n<center>\n<br>\n\n[![使用优惠码 Supplementaries 首月立减 20%](https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png)](https://www.akliz.net/supplementaries)\n\n## 🦉 我们的其他模组 🦉\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t1mYf6a.gif\" alt=\"闹鬼丰收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/f1NuS3t.png\" alt=\"雪之灵\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OO7HTbn.png\" alt=\"储物标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rRcgB1P.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gys7BpM.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KiuA6oe.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eWNxaRZ.png\" alt=\"MMM\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/G44hniG.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vUw51oj.png\" alt=\"JEED\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Bp2FNeY.png\" alt=\"更好的荷叶\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9trFDsF.png\" alt=\"进度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0RGkl5V.png\" alt=\"随机矿\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b74AB3D.png\" alt=\"好梦\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"> </a>\n<a href=\"https://www.modrinth.com/mod/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/z42bvio.gif\" alt=\"心石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"> </a>\n</center>",
